                                                "sense_id": "7fa4d024-5fa2-3458-9aa6-8cd06266ec74",
                                                "text": "Illustrating the strength of feeling, some said Dorries was “never here and is as useful as a chocolate teapot”, while “Dosser Dorries” posters appeared in the area."
